/*
  AISettings.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0202 · AISettings (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `AISettings` resolves (table "AISettings") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/settings/components/AISettings.tsx). The second group backs the native
  chrome (the P4 leaf freshness / loading / empty / error copy), so the Swift sources
  hold no English literals.

  Parity note on `ai.settings.costCap.amount`: the web value is the i18next template
  `${{spent}} / ${{cap}}`; the native catalog uses the equivalent positional
  `String(format:)` specifier so the two dollar parts interpolate identically.
*/

